year: 2026
date-released: 2026-08-02
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Publication artifacts for the paper "Solving 3x9 Quoridor with Independently
  Verifiable Winning-Strategy Certificates": two independently developed solver and
  verifier trees (emitter/judge), qcert-1 certificate pipeline and manifests,
  acceptance receipts, proof journals, and the compiled paper. The 3x9 board
  is a first-player win at 9 and 10 walls per player; at 10 walls the forcing
  horizon is exactly 35 plies, certified end to end.
